-- ONE RECOVERY, LIKE armBreakFix (034): the farm noticed its requests changing
-- nothing and asks for one hand harvest. Once per session, so a field that is simply
-- not ripe cannot keep nagging.
function Cache.armHarvestFix(feature, sent)
    if Cache.HarvestHealArmed or Cache.HarvestCaptureActive then return false end
    Cache.HarvestHealArmed = true
    Cache.notify({Title=feature .. " — Nothing Is Harvesting", Content=string.format(
        "%d harvest request(s) have gone out and no crop has changed, so the server is refusing every one. That is what a game update to the harvest format looks like. Harvest ONE crop BY HAND in the next 3 minutes and the script learns the current format — saved for every future session.",
        sent or 0), Duration=25})
    Cache.captureHarvest(180)
    return true
end

-- and the same for the SWING: combat had only the manual 'Record One Mob Hit', so a
-- rotated token meant standing in a field of slimes killing nothing until someone
-- thought to press it. 150 counts swings and watches for any health dropping or any
-- target dying; forty swings with neither asks for one hand swing.
