-- THE QUEUE HAS A TAB OF ITS OWN (order 52, between Build and Blueprints). It was
-- section 4 of the Build tab, which made Build 73 controls long with the queue's 25
-- spread through the bottom half of it among repair mode and auto rejoin. Created here
-- rather than in 082 because nothing before this part needs it: the two queue buttons
